(function(){var T=window.TRANSLATIONS;if(!T)return;var d={"tr":{"blog_p29_duplex_title":"Dupleks Paslanmaz Kaynağı (2205): Ferrit Dengesi, Isı Girdisi ve Tel Seçimi | ArmaWeld","blog_p29_duplex_meta_desc":"Dupleks paslanmaz çelik 2205 (1.4462) ve süper dupleks nasıl kaynatılır? Ferrit–östenit dengesi, ısı girdisi ve pasolar arası sıcaklık sınırları, 2209 tel, azotlu koruyucu ve kök gazı, sigma fazı riski ve ferrit ölçümü.","blog_p29_duplex_og_title":"Dupleks Paslanmaz Kaynağı 2205","blog_p29_duplex_tag":"Paslanmaz Çelik · Dupleks","blog_p29_duplex_h1":"Dupleks Paslanmaz Kaynağı (2205): Ferrit Dengesi, Isı Girdisi ve Tel Seçimi","blog_p29_duplex_breadcrumb3":"Dupleks Paslanmaz Kaynağı","blog_p29_duplex_read":"6 dk okuma","blog_p29_duplex_body":"<p>Dupleks paslanmaz çelikler, yaklaşık eşit oranda <strong>ferrit ve östenit</strong> içeren iki fazlı bir yapıya sahiptir. Bu yapı, 316L’ye göre yaklaşık iki kat akma dayanımı ve klorürlü ortamda gerilmeli korozyon çatlağına karşı çok daha iyi direnç sağlar. Kimya tesisleri, deniz suyu sistemleri, tanklar ve gıda ekipmanında giderek daha çok kullanılır. Ancak bu üstünlük, kaynakta faz dengesinin korunmasına bağlıdır.</p>\n<h2>Yaygın Kaliteler</h2>\n<table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Kalite</th><th>EN numarası</th><th>Tipik kullanım</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Lean dupleks (2304, 2101)</td><td>1.4362 / 1.4162</td><td>Yapısal, depolama tankları</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Standart dupleks 2205</td><td>1.4462</td><td>Kimya, proses ekipmanı, deniz suyu</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Süper dupleks 2507</td><td>1.4410</td><td>Agresif klorürlü ortamlar, açık deniz</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Asıl Konu: Faz Dengesi</h2>\n<p>Kaynak bölgesi çok hızlı soğursa, ferritten östenit oluşmaya yeterli zaman kalmaz ve yapı aşırı ferritik olur; tokluk ve korozyon direnci düşer. Çok yavaş soğursa veya bölge uzun süre 700–950 °C aralığında kalırsa, kırılgan <strong>sigma fazı</strong> gibi intermetalik fazlar oluşur; bu da tokluğu ve korozyon direncini ciddi şekilde bozar. Hedef, ikisinin arasında, dengeli bir soğumadır.</p>\n<p>Kaynak metali ve ITAB’da ferrit oranı genellikle yaklaşık %30–70 aralığında istenir; kesin aralık şartnameye göre belirlenir.</p>\n<h2>Isı Girdisi ve Pasolar Arası Sıcaklık</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2205:</strong> Isı girdisi genellikle yaklaşık 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm aralığında tutulur; pasolar arası sıcaklık çoğunlukla 150 °C ile sınırlanır.</li>\n<li><strong>Süper dupleks 2507:</strong> Aralık daha dardır; ısı girdisi yaklaşık 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm, pasolar arası sıcaklık çoğunlukla 100 °C ile sınırlanır.</li>\n<li>Çok ince kök pasoları ve çok düşük ısı girdisi aşırı ferrite, çok kalın pasolar ve sıcak çalışma intermetalik faza yol açar.</li>\n<li>Ön ısıtma normalde gerekmez; yalnızca yoğuşmayı önlemek için hafif ısıtma yapılabilir.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Sarf Malzeme</h2>\n<p>Dupleks kaynakta tel, ana malzemeden <strong>daha yüksek nikel</strong> içerir. 2205 için standart seçim <strong>2209</strong> (ISO 14343 tanımıyla 22 9 3 N L) telidir; ek nikel, hızlı soğuyan kaynak metalinde yeterli östenit oluşmasını sağlar. Süper dupleks için 2594 (25 9 4 N L) tipi teller kullanılır. Telsiz (otojen) kaynak, aşırı ferritik yapıya neden olduğundan genellikle kaçınılması gereken bir uygulamadır.</p>\n<h2>Koruyucu Gaz ve Kök Gazı</h2>\n<p>Azot, östenit oluşumunu destekler. Kaynak sırasında yüzeyden azot kaybını azaltmak için TIG kaynağında argona az miktarda (tipik olarak %1–2) azot eklenmiş koruyucu gazlar ve kök tarafında azotlu kök gazı kullanılabilir. Kök tarafındaki oksidasyon, standart paslanmazlarda olduğu gibi korozyonun başlangıç noktasıdır (bkz. <a href=\"paslanmaz-kaynak-temizleme-daglama-pasivasyon.html\">dağlama ve pasivasyon</a>).</p>\n<h2>Kontrol ve Testler</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ferrit ölçümü:</strong> Manyetik ölçüm cihazıyla kaynak metalinde ve gerektiğinde ITAB’da ferrit oranı ölçülür.</li>\n<li><strong>Yöntem nitelendirmesi:</strong> ISO 15614-1 deneylerine ek olarak, şartnameye göre metalografik inceleme, darbe deneyi ve ASTM G48 çukurcuk korozyonu testi istenebilir. Zararlı intermetalik fazlar için ASTM A923 testleri de sık referanstır.</li>\n<li><strong>Isıl işlem:</strong> Kaynak sonrası gerilim giderme yapılmaz; gerekiyorsa yalnızca tam çözeltiye alma tavı uygulanır ve bu da çoğu imalat parçasında pratik değildir.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Karbon Çelik ile Birleşim</h2>\n<p>Dupleks bir parçanın karbon çeliğe kaynatılması gerektiğinde, seyrelme ve faz dengesi birlikte değerlendirilir; 309L veya dupleks tipi teller şartlara göre seçilir (bkz. <a href=\"paslanmaz-karbon-celik-kaynagi-309l.html\">paslanmaz–karbon çelik kaynağı</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ArmaWeld'de:</strong> Dupleks işlerde ısı girdisini ve pasolar arası sıcaklığı WPS sınırları içinde tutar, ölçerek kaydederiz. Ferrit ölçümü ve şartnamede istenen ek testler, malzeme ve sarf seçimiyle birlikte teklif aşamasında planlanır. <a href=\"../kaynak-yontemleri.html\">Kaynak yöntemlerimiz →</a></p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_faq":"<h2>Sık Sorulan Sorular</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Dupleks 2205 hangi telle kaynatılır?</h3><p>Genellikle 2209 (ISO 14343 22 9 3 N L) teliyle. Ek nikel, hızlı soğuyan kaynak metalinde yeterli östenit oluşmasını sağlar.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Dupleks kaynağında ısı girdisi ne olmalı?</h3><p>2205 için genellikle yaklaşık 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm, süper dupleks 2507 için yaklaşık 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm. Kesin değer WPS ve şartnamede belirlenir.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Sigma fazı nedir?</h3><p>Dupleks çeliklerde 700–950 °C aralığında uzun süre kalındığında oluşan kırılgan intermetalik fazdır; tokluğu ve korozyon direncini düşürür.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Dupleks kaynakta ferrit oranı nasıl kontrol edilir?</h3><p>Manyetik ferrit ölçüm cihazıyla kaynak metalinde ölçülür; genellikle yaklaşık %30–70 aralığı hedeflenir.</p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_cta_h3":"Dupleks paslanmazda kontrollü kaynak","blog_p29_duplex_cta_p":"Dupleks parça çiziminizi ve şartnamenizi gönderin; kaynak ve test planıyla teklif sunalım.","blog_p29_duplex_cta_btn":"Teklif İste →","blog_related_h":"İlgili Makaleler","blog_tig_h1":"TIG Kaynak ile Paslanmaz Çelik İşleme: 304 ve 316L Alaşımları","blog_p27_pickling_h1":"Paslanmaz Kaynak Temizleme: Isı Renkleri, Dağlama ve Pasivasyon","blog_p28_dissimilar_h1":"Paslanmaz ile Karbon Çelik Kaynağı: 309L Tel, Seyrelme ve Galvanik Korozyon","blog_paslanmaz_celik_imalat_h1":"Paslanmaz Çelik Kaynaklı İmalat: Gıda, İlaç, Kimya"},"en":{"blog_p29_duplex_title":"Welding Duplex Stainless Steel (2205): Ferrite Balance, Heat Input and Filler | ArmaWeld","blog_p29_duplex_meta_desc":"How do you weld duplex stainless 2205 (1.4462) and super duplex? Ferrite–austenite balance, heat input and interpass limits, 2209 filler, nitrogen-bearing shielding and backing gas, sigma phase risk and ferrite measurement.","blog_p29_duplex_og_title":"Welding Duplex Stainless 2205","blog_p29_duplex_tag":"Stainless Steel · Duplex","blog_p29_duplex_h1":"Welding Duplex Stainless Steel (2205): Ferrite Balance, Heat Input and Filler","blog_p29_duplex_breadcrumb3":"Welding Duplex Stainless","blog_p29_duplex_read":"6 min read","blog_p29_duplex_body":"<p>Duplex stainless steels have a two-phase structure with roughly equal amounts of <strong>ferrite and austenite</strong>. It gives about twice the yield strength of 316L and much better resistance to chloride stress corrosion cracking. They are increasingly used in chemical plants, seawater systems, tanks and food equipment. That advantage, however, depends on keeping the phase balance during welding.</p>\n<h2>Common Grades</h2>\n<table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Grade</th><th>EN number</th><th>Typical use</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Lean duplex (2304, 2101)</td><td>1.4362 / 1.4162</td><td>Structural, storage tanks</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Standard duplex 2205</td><td>1.4462</td><td>Chemical, process equipment, seawater</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Super duplex 2507</td><td>1.4410</td><td>Aggressive chloride environments, offshore</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>The Real Issue: Phase Balance</h2>\n<p>If the weld zone cools too fast, there is not enough time for austenite to form from ferrite and the structure becomes overly ferritic; toughness and corrosion resistance drop. If it cools too slowly or stays long at 700–950 °C, intermetallic phases such as brittle <strong>sigma phase</strong> form and severely impair toughness and corrosion resistance. The aim is balanced cooling between the two.</p>\n<p>Ferrite in weld metal and HAZ is generally required at roughly 30–70%; the exact range is set by the specification.</p>\n<h2>Heat Input and Interpass Temperature</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2205:</strong> heat input is usually kept at about 0.5–2.5 kJ/mm; interpass temperature mostly limited to 150 °C.</li>\n<li><strong>Super duplex 2507:</strong> a narrower window; heat input about 0.2–1.5 kJ/mm, interpass mostly limited to 100 °C.</li>\n<li>Very thin root passes and very low heat input lead to excess ferrite; very heavy passes and hot working lead to intermetallics.</li>\n<li>Preheat is normally not needed; light warming may be used only to prevent condensation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Consumables</h2>\n<p>Duplex filler contains <strong>more nickel</strong> than the parent metal. The standard choice for 2205 is <strong>2209</strong> (22 9 3 N L to ISO 14343); the extra nickel ensures enough austenite forms in the fast-cooling weld metal. For super duplex, 2594 type (25 9 4 N L) wires are used. Autogenous (filler-free) welding causes an overly ferritic structure and is generally to be avoided.</p>\n<h2>Shielding and Backing Gas</h2>\n<p>Nitrogen promotes austenite. To limit nitrogen loss from the surface during welding, TIG shielding gases with a small addition of nitrogen (typically 1–2%) to argon and nitrogen-bearing backing gas can be used. Root-side oxidation is, as with standard stainless, where corrosion starts (see <a href=\"paslanmaz-kaynak-temizleme-daglama-pasivasyon.html\">pickling and passivation</a>).</p>\n<h2>Inspection and Testing</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ferrite measurement:</strong> ferrite content in weld metal, and in the HAZ where required, is measured with a magnetic instrument.</li>\n<li><strong>Procedure qualification:</strong> in addition to ISO 15614-1 tests, the specification may require metallography, impact testing and ASTM G48 pitting tests. ASTM A923 tests for detrimental intermetallic phases are also a common reference.</li>\n<li><strong>Heat treatment:</strong> no post-weld stress relief; if needed, only full solution annealing, which is impractical for most fabricated parts.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Joining to Carbon Steel</h2>\n<p>When a duplex part must be welded to carbon steel, dilution and phase balance are assessed together; 309L or duplex-type fillers are selected depending on conditions (see <a href=\"paslanmaz-karbon-celik-kaynagi-309l.html\">stainless to carbon steel welding</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>At ArmaWeld:</strong> on duplex work we keep heat input and interpass temperature within WPS limits and measure and record them. Ferrite measurement and any extra tests in the specification are planned at quotation together with material and consumable selection. <a href=\"../kaynak-yontemleri.html\">Our welding methods →</a></p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_faq":"<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Which filler is used for duplex 2205?</h3><p>Usually 2209 (ISO 14343 22 9 3 N L). The extra nickel ensures enough austenite forms in the fast-cooling weld metal.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>What heat input is right for duplex?</h3><p>Usually about 0.5–2.5 kJ/mm for 2205 and about 0.2–1.5 kJ/mm for super duplex 2507; the exact value is set in the WPS and specification.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>What is sigma phase?</h3><p>A brittle intermetallic phase that forms in duplex steels held at 700–950 °C; it reduces toughness and corrosion resistance.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>How is ferrite content checked in duplex welds?</h3><p>With a magnetic ferrite measuring instrument on the weld metal; roughly 30–70% is generally targeted.</p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_cta_h3":"Controlled welding of duplex stainless","blog_p29_duplex_cta_p":"Send your duplex part drawing and specification; we will quote with a welding and test plan.","blog_p29_duplex_cta_btn":"Request a Quote →","blog_related_h":"Related Articles","blog_tig_h1":"TIG Welding of Stainless Steel: 304 and 316L Alloys","blog_p27_pickling_h1":"Cleaning Stainless Steel Welds: Heat Tint, Pickling and Passivation","blog_p28_dissimilar_h1":"Welding Stainless to Carbon Steel: 309L Filler, Dilution and Galvanic Corrosion","blog_paslanmaz_celik_imalat_h1":"Stainless Steel Welded Manufacturing: Food, Pharma, Chemical"},"de":{"blog_p29_duplex_title":"Duplex-Edelstahl schweißen (2205): Ferritgehalt, Wärmeeinbringung und Zusatzwerkstoff | ArmaWeld","blog_p29_duplex_meta_desc":"Wie schweißt man Duplex 2205 (1.4462) und Superduplex? Ferrit-Austenit-Gleichgewicht, Grenzen für Wärmeeinbringung und Zwischenlagentemperatur, 2209-Zusatz, stickstoffhaltiges Schutz- und Formiergas, Sigmaphase und Ferritmessung.","blog_p29_duplex_og_title":"Duplex-Edelstahl 2205 schweißen","blog_p29_duplex_tag":"Edelstahl · Duplex","blog_p29_duplex_h1":"Duplex-Edelstahl schweißen (2205): Ferritgehalt, Wärmeeinbringung und Zusatzwerkstoff","blog_p29_duplex_breadcrumb3":"Duplex schweißen","blog_p29_duplex_read":"6 Min. Lesezeit","blog_p29_duplex_body":"<p>Duplexstähle haben ein zweiphasiges Gefüge aus etwa gleichen Anteilen <strong>Ferrit und Austenit</strong>. Es bietet rund die doppelte Streckgrenze von 316L und eine deutlich bessere Beständigkeit gegen chloridinduzierte Spannungsrisskorrosion. Sie werden zunehmend in Chemieanlagen, Meerwassersystemen, Behältern und Lebensmittelanlagen eingesetzt. Dieser Vorteil hängt jedoch davon ab, dass das Phasengleichgewicht beim Schweißen erhalten bleibt.</p>\n<h2>Gängige Sorten</h2>\n<table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Sorte</th><th>Werkstoffnummer</th><th>Typische Anwendung</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Lean Duplex (2304, 2101)</td><td>1.4362 / 1.4162</td><td>Tragwerke, Lagertanks</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Standard-Duplex 2205</td><td>1.4462</td><td>Chemie, Prozessanlagen, Meerwasser</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Superduplex 2507</td><td>1.4410</td><td>Aggressive Chloridmedien, Offshore</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Kernthema: Phasengleichgewicht</h2>\n<p>Kühlt die Nahtzone zu schnell ab, bleibt keine Zeit für die Austenitbildung aus dem Ferrit, das Gefüge wird zu ferritisch; Zähigkeit und Korrosionsbeständigkeit sinken. Kühlt sie zu langsam ab oder verweilt lange bei 700–950 °C, entstehen intermetallische Phasen wie die spröde <strong>Sigmaphase</strong>, die Zähigkeit und Korrosionsbeständigkeit stark verschlechtern. Ziel ist eine ausgewogene Abkühlung dazwischen.</p>\n<p>Der Ferritgehalt in Schweißgut und WEZ wird meist im Bereich von etwa 30–70 % gefordert; der genaue Bereich steht in der Spezifikation.</p>\n<h2>Wärmeeinbringung und Zwischenlagentemperatur</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2205:</strong> Wärmeeinbringung meist etwa 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm; Zwischenlagentemperatur meist auf 150 °C begrenzt.</li>\n<li><strong>Superduplex 2507:</strong> engeres Fenster; etwa 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm, Zwischenlagentemperatur meist 100 °C.</li>\n<li>Sehr dünne Wurzellagen und sehr geringe Wärmeeinbringung führen zu Ferritüberschuss, sehr dicke Lagen und heißes Arbeiten zu intermetallischen Phasen.</li>\n<li>Vorwärmen ist normalerweise nicht nötig; leichtes Anwärmen höchstens gegen Kondensat.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Zusatzwerkstoffe</h2>\n<p>Duplex-Zusätze enthalten <strong>mehr Nickel</strong> als der Grundwerkstoff. Standard für 2205 ist <strong>2209</strong> (nach ISO 14343 22 9 3 N L); das zusätzliche Nickel sorgt für ausreichend Austenit im schnell abkühlenden Schweißgut. Für Superduplex werden Drähte vom Typ 2594 (25 9 4 N L) verwendet. Schweißen ohne Zusatz führt zu einem zu ferritischen Gefüge und ist in der Regel zu vermeiden.</p>\n<h2>Schutz- und Formiergas</h2>\n<p>Stickstoff fördert die Austenitbildung. Um Stickstoffverluste an der Oberfläche zu begrenzen, können beim WIG-Schweißen Argon mit geringem Stickstoffzusatz (typisch 1–2 %) und stickstoffhaltige Formiergase genutzt werden. Wurzelseitige Oxidation ist wie bei Standard-Edelstahl der Ausgangspunkt der Korrosion (siehe <a href=\"paslanmaz-kaynak-temizleme-daglama-pasivasyon.html\">Beizen und Passivieren</a>).</p>\n<h2>Prüfung</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ferritmessung:</strong> Ferritgehalt im Schweißgut und bei Bedarf in der WEZ mit magnetischem Messgerät.</li>\n<li><strong>Verfahrensprüfung:</strong> zusätzlich zu ISO 15614-1 können Metallografie, Kerbschlagprüfung und Lochfraßprüfung nach ASTM G48 gefordert werden. Häufige Referenz für schädliche intermetallische Phasen ist ASTM A923.</li>\n<li><strong>Wärmebehandlung:</strong> kein Spannungsarmglühen; falls nötig, nur Lösungsglühen, was bei den meisten Fertigungsteilen nicht praktikabel ist.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Verbindung mit Baustahl</h2>\n<p>Muss ein Duplexteil an Baustahl geschweißt werden, werden Aufmischung und Phasengleichgewicht gemeinsam bewertet; je nach Bedingungen 309L- oder Duplex-Zusätze (siehe <a href=\"paslanmaz-karbon-celik-kaynagi-309l.html\">Schwarz-Weiß-Verbindungen</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bei ArmaWeld:</strong> Bei Duplex halten wir Wärmeeinbringung und Zwischenlagentemperatur innerhalb der WPS-Grenzen, messen und dokumentieren sie. Ferritmessung und zusätzliche Prüfungen der Spezifikation planen wir im Angebot zusammen mit Werkstoff- und Zusatzwahl. <a href=\"../kaynak-yontemleri.html\">Unsere Schweißverfahren →</a></p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_faq":"<h2>Häufige Fragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welcher Zusatz für Duplex 2205?</h3><p>Meist 2209 (ISO 14343 22 9 3 N L). Das zusätzliche Nickel sorgt für genügend Austenit im schnell abkühlenden Schweißgut.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welche Wärmeeinbringung bei Duplex?</h3><p>Bei 2205 meist etwa 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm, bei Superduplex 2507 etwa 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm; der genaue Wert steht in WPS und Spezifikation.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Was ist die Sigmaphase?</h3><p>Eine spröde intermetallische Phase, die bei längerer Verweildauer bei 700–950 °C in Duplexstählen entsteht und Zähigkeit sowie Korrosionsbeständigkeit senkt.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wie prüft man den Ferritgehalt?</h3><p>Mit einem magnetischen Ferritmessgerät am Schweißgut; meist werden etwa 30–70 % angestrebt.</p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_cta_h3":"Kontrolliertes Schweißen von Duplex-Edelstahl","blog_p29_duplex_cta_p":"Senden Sie Zeichnung und Spezifikation Ihres Duplexteils; wir bieten mit Schweiß- und Prüfplan an.","blog_p29_duplex_cta_btn":"Angebot anfordern →","blog_related_h":"Verwandte Artikel","blog_tig_h1":"WIG-Schweißen von Edelstahl: 304 und 316L Legierungen","blog_p27_pickling_h1":"Edelstahlnähte reinigen: Anlauffarben, Beizen und Passivieren","blog_p28_dissimilar_h1":"Schwarz-Weiß-Verbindungen schweißen: 309L, Aufmischung und Kontaktkorrosion","blog_paslanmaz_celik_imalat_h1":"Edelstahl-Schweißfertigung: Lebensmittel, Pharma, Chemie"},"es":{"blog_p29_duplex_title":"Soldadura de inoxidable dúplex (2205): equilibrio de ferrita, aporte térmico y consumible | ArmaWeld","blog_p29_duplex_meta_desc":"Cómo soldar inoxidable dúplex 2205 (1.4462) y superdúplex: equilibrio ferrita–austenita, límites de aporte térmico y temperatura entre pasadas, hilo 2209, gas de protección y respaldo con nitrógeno, riesgo de fase sigma y medición de ferrita.","blog_p29_duplex_og_title":"Soldadura de inoxidable dúplex 2205","blog_p29_duplex_tag":"Acero inoxidable · Dúplex","blog_p29_duplex_h1":"Soldadura de inoxidable dúplex (2205): equilibrio de ferrita, aporte térmico y consumible","blog_p29_duplex_breadcrumb3":"Soldadura de dúplex","blog_p29_duplex_read":"6 min de lectura","blog_p29_duplex_body":"<p>Los inoxidables dúplex tienen una estructura bifásica con proporciones similares de <strong>ferrita y austenita</strong>. Ofrece aproximadamente el doble de límite elástico que el 316L y mucha mejor resistencia a la corrosión bajo tensión por cloruros. Se usan cada vez más en plantas químicas, sistemas de agua de mar, depósitos y equipos alimentarios. Esa ventaja depende de conservar el equilibrio de fases al soldar.</p>\n<h2>Calidades habituales</h2>\n<table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Calidad</th><th>Número EN</th><th>Uso típico</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Lean dúplex (2304, 2101)</td><td>1.4362 / 1.4162</td><td>Estructural, depósitos de almacenamiento</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Dúplex estándar 2205</td><td>1.4462</td><td>Química, equipos de proceso, agua de mar</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Superdúplex 2507</td><td>1.4410</td><td>Ambientes con cloruros agresivos, offshore</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>La clave: el equilibrio de fases</h2>\n<p>Si la zona soldada se enfría demasiado rápido, no hay tiempo para que se forme austenita a partir de la ferrita y la estructura queda demasiado ferrítica; bajan tenacidad y resistencia a la corrosión. Si se enfría demasiado despacio o permanece mucho tiempo entre 700 y 950 °C, se forman fases intermetálicas como la frágil <strong>fase sigma</strong>, que deterioran gravemente ambas propiedades. El objetivo es un enfriamiento equilibrado entre ambos extremos.</p>\n<p>La ferrita en el metal de soldadura y en la ZAT suele exigirse aproximadamente entre el 30 y el 70 %; el rango exacto lo fija la especificación.</p>\n<h2>Aporte térmico y temperatura entre pasadas</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2205:</strong> aporte térmico normalmente de unos 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm; temperatura entre pasadas limitada en general a 150 °C.</li>\n<li><strong>Superdúplex 2507:</strong> ventana más estrecha; unos 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm y entre pasadas en general 100 °C.</li>\n<li>Raíces muy finas y aporte muy bajo dan exceso de ferrita; pasadas muy gruesas y trabajo en caliente, intermetálicos.</li>\n<li>Normalmente no se precalienta; solo un ligero calentamiento para evitar condensación.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Consumibles</h2>\n<p>El aporte dúplex contiene <strong>más níquel</strong> que el metal base. Para 2205 la elección estándar es el <strong>2209</strong> (22 9 3 N L según ISO 14343); el níquel adicional asegura suficiente austenita en el metal de soldadura que se enfría rápido. Para superdúplex se usan hilos tipo 2594 (25 9 4 N L). La soldadura sin aporte da una estructura demasiado ferrítica y en general debe evitarse.</p>\n<h2>Gas de protección y de respaldo</h2>\n<p>El nitrógeno favorece la austenita. Para limitar su pérdida superficial, en TIG pueden usarse mezclas de argón con un poco de nitrógeno (típicamente 1–2 %) y gas de respaldo con nitrógeno. La oxidación en la raíz es, como en el inoxidable estándar, el punto de inicio de la corrosión (ver <a href=\"paslanmaz-kaynak-temizleme-daglama-pasivasyon.html\">decapado y pasivado</a>).</p>\n<h2>Control y ensayos</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Medición de ferrita:</strong> con un equipo magnético en el metal de soldadura y, si se exige, en la ZAT.</li>\n<li><strong>Cualificación:</strong> además de los ensayos ISO 15614-1, la especificación puede exigir metalografía, impacto y ensayo de picaduras ASTM G48. La ASTM A923 es referencia habitual para fases intermetálicas perjudiciales.</li>\n<li><strong>Tratamiento térmico:</strong> sin alivio de tensiones; si es necesario, solo recocido de solubilización completo, poco práctico en la mayoría de piezas fabricadas.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Unión con acero al carbono</h2>\n<p>Si una pieza dúplex debe soldarse a acero al carbono, se evalúan juntos dilución y equilibrio de fases; se eligen aportes 309L o tipo dúplex según las condiciones (ver <a href=\"paslanmaz-karbon-celik-kaynagi-309l.html\">soldar inoxidable con acero al carbono</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>En ArmaWeld:</strong> en trabajos dúplex mantenemos el aporte térmico y la temperatura entre pasadas dentro de los límites de la WPS, midiéndolos y registrándolos. La medición de ferrita y los ensayos adicionales de la especificación se planifican en la oferta junto con material y consumibles. <a href=\"../kaynak-yontemleri.html\">Nuestros procesos de soldadura →</a></p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_faq":"<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Con qué aporte se suelda el dúplex 2205?</h3><p>Normalmente con 2209 (ISO 14343 22 9 3 N L). El níquel adicional asegura suficiente austenita en el metal de soldadura.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué aporte térmico usar en dúplex?</h3><p>En 2205 unos 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm y en superdúplex 2507 unos 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm; el valor exacto lo fijan la WPS y la especificación.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué es la fase sigma?</h3><p>Una fase intermetálica frágil que se forma en el dúplex mantenido entre 700 y 950 °C; reduce tenacidad y resistencia a la corrosión.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Cómo se controla la ferrita?</h3><p>Con un medidor magnético de ferrita en el metal de soldadura; en general se busca un 30–70 % aproximadamente.</p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_cta_h3":"Soldadura controlada de inoxidable dúplex","blog_p29_duplex_cta_p":"Envíenos el plano y la especificación de su pieza dúplex; ofertamos con plan de soldadura y ensayos.","blog_p29_duplex_cta_btn":"Solicitar oferta →","blog_related_h":"Artículos relacionados","blog_tig_h1":"Soldadura TIG de Acero Inoxidable: Aleaciones 304 y 316L","blog_p27_pickling_h1":"Limpieza de soldaduras de inoxidable: coloración térmica, decapado y pasivado","blog_p28_dissimilar_h1":"Soldar inoxidable con acero al carbono: aporte 309L, dilución y corrosión galvánica","blog_paslanmaz_celik_imalat_h1":"Fabricación Soldada en Acero Inoxidable: Alimentación, Farma, Química"},"fr":{"blog_p29_duplex_title":"Souder l’inox duplex (2205) : équilibre de ferrite, énergie et métal d’apport | ArmaWeld","blog_p29_duplex_meta_desc":"Comment souder l’inox duplex 2205 (1.4462) et le super duplex ? Équilibre ferrite–austénite, limites d’énergie et de température entre passes, fil 2209, gaz de protection et envers azotés, phase sigma et mesure de ferrite.","blog_p29_duplex_og_title":"Souder l’inox duplex 2205","blog_p29_duplex_tag":"Acier inoxydable · Duplex","blog_p29_duplex_h1":"Souder l’inox duplex (2205) : équilibre de ferrite, énergie et métal d’apport","blog_p29_duplex_breadcrumb3":"Souder le duplex","blog_p29_duplex_read":"6 min de lecture","blog_p29_duplex_body":"<p>Les inox duplex ont une structure biphasée composée à parts à peu près égales de <strong>ferrite et d’austénite</strong>. Elle offre environ le double de limite d’élasticité du 316L et une bien meilleure résistance à la corrosion sous contrainte par les chlorures. On les utilise de plus en plus dans la chimie, l’eau de mer, les réservoirs et l’agroalimentaire. Cet avantage dépend toutefois du maintien de l’équilibre des phases au soudage.</p>\n<h2>Nuances courantes</h2>\n<table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Nuance</th><th>Numéro EN</th><th>Usage typique</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Lean duplex (2304, 2101)</td><td>1.4362 / 1.4162</td><td>Structures, réservoirs de stockage</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Duplex standard 2205</td><td>1.4462</td><td>Chimie, équipements de procédé, eau de mer</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Super duplex 2507</td><td>1.4410</td><td>Milieux chlorurés agressifs, offshore</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>L’enjeu : l’équilibre des phases</h2>\n<p>Si la zone soudée refroidit trop vite, l’austénite n’a pas le temps de se former à partir de la ferrite et la structure devient trop ferritique ; ténacité et tenue à la corrosion baissent. Si elle refroidit trop lentement ou reste longtemps entre 700 et 950 °C, des phases intermétalliques comme la fragile <strong>phase sigma</strong> apparaissent et dégradent fortement ces propriétés. L’objectif est un refroidissement équilibré entre les deux.</p>\n<p>La ferrite du métal fondu et de la ZAT est généralement exigée entre environ 30 et 70 % ; la plage exacte est fixée par la spécification.</p>\n<h2>Énergie et température entre passes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2205 :</strong> énergie généralement d’environ 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm ; température entre passes le plus souvent limitée à 150 °C.</li>\n<li><strong>Super duplex 2507 :</strong> fenêtre plus étroite ; environ 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm et entre passes le plus souvent 100 °C.</li>\n<li>Racines très fines et énergie très faible donnent un excès de ferrite ; passes très grosses et travail à chaud, des intermétalliques.</li>\n<li>Pas de préchauffage normalement ; un léger chauffage seulement contre la condensation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Produits d’apport</h2>\n<p>Le fil duplex contient <strong>plus de nickel</strong> que le métal de base. Pour le 2205, le choix standard est le <strong>2209</strong> (22 9 3 N L selon ISO 14343) ; le nickel supplémentaire assure assez d’austénite dans le métal fondu qui refroidit vite. Pour le super duplex, on utilise des fils de type 2594 (25 9 4 N L). Le soudage sans apport donne une structure trop ferritique et est généralement à éviter.</p>\n<h2>Gaz de protection et envers</h2>\n<p>L’azote favorise l’austénite. Pour limiter sa perte en surface, on peut utiliser en TIG de l’argon additionné d’un peu d’azote (typiquement 1–2 %) et un gaz envers azoté. L’oxydation côté racine est, comme pour l’inox standard, le point de départ de la corrosion (voir <a href=\"paslanmaz-kaynak-temizleme-daglama-pasivasyon.html\">décapage et passivation</a>).</p>\n<h2>Contrôles et essais</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mesure de ferrite :</strong> au ferritoscope sur le métal fondu et, si demandé, en ZAT.</li>\n<li><strong>Qualification :</strong> en plus des essais ISO 15614-1, la spécification peut demander métallographie, résilience et essai de piqûration ASTM G48. L’ASTM A923 est une référence courante pour les phases intermétalliques nocives.</li>\n<li><strong>Traitement thermique :</strong> pas de détensionnement ; si nécessaire, seulement une hypertrempe complète, peu praticable pour la plupart des pièces fabriquées.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Assemblage avec l’acier carbone</h2>\n<p>Si une pièce duplex doit être soudée à de l’acier carbone, dilution et équilibre des phases sont évalués ensemble ; fils 309L ou de type duplex selon les conditions (voir <a href=\"paslanmaz-karbon-celik-kaynagi-309l.html\">souder l’inox sur l’acier carbone</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Chez ArmaWeld :</strong> sur le duplex, nous maintenons l’énergie et la température entre passes dans les limites du DMOS, en les mesurant et les enregistrant. La mesure de ferrite et les essais supplémentaires de la spécification sont planifiés au devis avec le choix des matériaux et des produits d’apport. <a href=\"../kaynak-yontemleri.html\">Nos procédés de soudage →</a></p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_faq":"<h2>Questions fréquentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quel fil pour le duplex 2205 ?</h3><p>Généralement le 2209 (ISO 14343 22 9 3 N L). Le nickel supplémentaire assure assez d’austénite dans le métal fondu.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quelle énergie pour le duplex ?</h3><p>Environ 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm pour le 2205 et 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm pour le super duplex 2507 ; la valeur exacte figure dans le DMOS et la spécification.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Qu’est-ce que la phase sigma ?</h3><p>Une phase intermétallique fragile qui se forme dans le duplex maintenu entre 700 et 950 °C ; elle réduit ténacité et tenue à la corrosion.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Comment contrôler la ferrite ?</h3><p>Au ferritoscope sur le métal fondu ; on vise généralement environ 30–70 %.</p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_cta_h3":"Un soudage maîtrisé de l’inox duplex","blog_p29_duplex_cta_p":"Envoyez le plan et la spécification de votre pièce duplex ; nous chiffrons avec un plan de soudage et d’essais.","blog_p29_duplex_cta_btn":"Demander un devis →","blog_related_h":"Articles associés","blog_tig_h1":"Soudage TIG de l'inox 304 et 316L : Guide pratique","blog_p27_pickling_h1":"Nettoyer les soudures inox : colorations thermiques, décapage et passivation","blog_p28_dissimilar_h1":"Souder l’inox sur l’acier carbone : fil 309L, dilution et corrosion galvanique","blog_paslanmaz_celik_imalat_h1":"Fabrication Soudée Inox : Agroalimentaire, Pharma, Chimie"},"it":{"blog_p29_duplex_title":"Saldatura dell’inox duplex (2205): equilibrio della ferrite, apporto termico e filo | ArmaWeld","blog_p29_duplex_meta_desc":"Come si salda l’inox duplex 2205 (1.4462) e il super duplex? Equilibrio ferrite–austenite, limiti di apporto termico e interpass, filo 2209, gas di protezione e di rovescio con azoto, fase sigma e misura della ferrite.","blog_p29_duplex_og_title":"Saldatura dell’inox duplex 2205","blog_p29_duplex_tag":"Acciaio inox · Duplex","blog_p29_duplex_h1":"Saldatura dell’inox duplex (2205): equilibrio della ferrite, apporto termico e filo","blog_p29_duplex_breadcrumb3":"Saldatura duplex","blog_p29_duplex_read":"6 min di lettura","blog_p29_duplex_body":"<p>Gli inox duplex hanno una struttura bifasica con quote simili di <strong>ferrite e austenite</strong>. Offre circa il doppio dello snervamento del 316L e una resistenza molto migliore alla tensocorrosione da cloruri. Sono sempre più usati in impianti chimici, sistemi ad acqua di mare, serbatoi e attrezzature alimentari. Il vantaggio dipende però dal mantenimento dell’equilibrio delle fasi in saldatura.</p>\n<h2>Qualità comuni</h2>\n<table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Qualità</th><th>Numero EN</th><th>Impiego tipico</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Lean duplex (2304, 2101)</td><td>1.4362 / 1.4162</td><td>Strutture, serbatoi di stoccaggio</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Duplex standard 2205</td><td>1.4462</td><td>Chimica, apparecchiature di processo, acqua di mare</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Super duplex 2507</td><td>1.4410</td><td>Ambienti con cloruri aggressivi, offshore</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Il punto chiave: l’equilibrio delle fasi</h2>\n<p>Se la zona saldata si raffredda troppo in fretta, l’austenite non ha tempo di formarsi dalla ferrite e la struttura diventa troppo ferritica; calano tenacità e resistenza alla corrosione. Se si raffredda troppo lentamente o resta a lungo tra 700 e 950 °C, si formano fasi intermetalliche come la fragile <strong>fase sigma</strong>, che peggiorano gravemente queste proprietà. L’obiettivo è un raffreddamento equilibrato tra i due estremi.</p>\n<p>La ferrite nel metallo saldato e nella ZTA è di solito richiesta tra circa il 30 e il 70 %; l’intervallo esatto lo fissa la specifica.</p>\n<h2>Apporto termico e temperatura interpass</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2205:</strong> apporto termico di solito circa 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm; interpass per lo più limitato a 150 °C.</li>\n<li><strong>Super duplex 2507:</strong> finestra più stretta; circa 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm e interpass per lo più 100 °C.</li>\n<li>Radici molto sottili e apporto molto basso portano a eccesso di ferrite; passate molto spesse e lavoro a caldo, a intermetallici.</li>\n<li>Di norma niente preriscaldo; al massimo un leggero riscaldamento contro la condensa.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Consumabili</h2>\n<p>Il filo duplex contiene <strong>più nichel</strong> del materiale base. Per il 2205 la scelta standard è il <strong>2209</strong> (22 9 3 N L secondo ISO 14343); il nichel aggiuntivo assicura austenite sufficiente nel metallo saldato che si raffredda rapidamente. Per il super duplex si usano fili tipo 2594 (25 9 4 N L). La saldatura senza apporto dà una struttura troppo ferritica ed è in genere da evitare.</p>\n<h2>Gas di protezione e di rovescio</h2>\n<p>L’azoto favorisce l’austenite. Per limitarne la perdita superficiale, in TIG si possono usare miscele di argon con poco azoto (tipicamente 1–2 %) e gas di rovescio azotati. L’ossidazione al rovescio è, come per l’inox standard, il punto di innesco della corrosione (vedi <a href=\"paslanmaz-kaynak-temizleme-daglama-pasivasyon.html\">decapaggio e passivazione</a>).</p>\n<h2>Controlli e prove</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Misura della ferrite:</strong> con strumento magnetico sul metallo saldato e, se richiesto, nella ZTA.</li>\n<li><strong>Qualifica:</strong> oltre alle prove ISO 15614-1 la specifica può richiedere metallografia, resilienza e prova di vaiolatura ASTM G48. L’ASTM A923 è riferimento comune per le fasi intermetalliche dannose.</li>\n<li><strong>Trattamento termico:</strong> nessuna distensione; se necessario solo solubilizzazione completa, poco pratica per la maggior parte dei pezzi fabbricati.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Giunzione con acciaio al carbonio</h2>\n<p>Se un pezzo duplex va saldato ad acciaio al carbonio, diluizione ed equilibrio delle fasi si valutano insieme; si scelgono fili 309L o di tipo duplex secondo le condizioni (vedi <a href=\"paslanmaz-karbon-celik-kaynagi-309l.html\">saldare inox con acciaio al carbonio</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>In ArmaWeld:</strong> nei lavori duplex manteniamo apporto termico e interpass entro i limiti della WPS, misurandoli e registrandoli. Misura della ferrite e prove aggiuntive della specifica si pianificano in offerta insieme alla scelta di materiali e consumabili. <a href=\"../kaynak-yontemleri.html\">I nostri processi di saldatura →</a></p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_faq":"<h2>Domande frequenti</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Con quale filo si salda il duplex 2205?</h3><p>Di solito con 2209 (ISO 14343 22 9 3 N L). Il nichel aggiuntivo assicura austenite sufficiente nel metallo saldato.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quale apporto termico per il duplex?</h3><p>Per il 2205 circa 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm, per il super duplex 2507 circa 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm; il valore esatto è in WPS e specifica.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Cos’è la fase sigma?</h3><p>Una fase intermetallica fragile che si forma nel duplex mantenuto tra 700 e 950 °C; riduce tenacità e resistenza alla corrosione.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Come si controlla la ferrite?</h3><p>Con un misuratore magnetico di ferrite sul metallo saldato; in genere si punta a circa il 30–70 %.</p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_cta_h3":"Saldatura controllata dell’inox duplex","blog_p29_duplex_cta_p":"Inviateci disegno e specifica del pezzo duplex; quotiamo con piano di saldatura e prove.","blog_p29_duplex_cta_btn":"Richiedi un preventivo →","blog_related_h":"Articoli correlati","blog_tig_h1":"Saldatura TIG dell'acciaio inossidabile: leghe 304 e 316L","blog_p27_pickling_h1":"Pulizia delle saldature inox: colorazioni termiche, decapaggio e passivazione","blog_p28_dissimilar_h1":"Saldare inox con acciaio al carbonio: filo 309L, diluizione e corrosione galvanica","blog_paslanmaz_celik_imalat_h1":"Carpenteria saldata in acciaio inossidabile: alimentare, farmaceutico, chimico"},"nl":{"blog_p29_duplex_title":"Duplex-RVS lassen (2205): ferrietbalans, warmte-inbreng en toevoegmateriaal | ArmaWeld","blog_p29_duplex_meta_desc":"Hoe las je duplex RVS 2205 (1.4462) en superduplex? Ferriet-austenietbalans, grenzen voor warmte-inbreng en tussenlaagtemperatuur, 2209-draad, stikstofhoudend beschermgas en backing gas, sigmafase en ferrietmeting.","blog_p29_duplex_og_title":"Duplex-RVS 2205 lassen","blog_p29_duplex_tag":"Roestvast staal · Duplex","blog_p29_duplex_h1":"Duplex-RVS lassen (2205): ferrietbalans, warmte-inbreng en toevoegmateriaal","blog_p29_duplex_breadcrumb3":"Duplex lassen","blog_p29_duplex_read":"6 min lezen","blog_p29_duplex_body":"<p>Duplex roestvast staal heeft een tweefasige structuur met ongeveer gelijke delen <strong>ferriet en austeniet</strong>. Dat geeft ongeveer twee keer de vloeigrens van 316L en een veel betere weerstand tegen chloride-spanningscorrosie. Het wordt steeds vaker toegepast in chemische installaties, zeewatersystemen, tanks en voedingsmiddelenapparatuur. Dat voordeel hangt wel af van het behoud van de fasebalans tijdens het lassen.</p>\n<h2>Gangbare kwaliteiten</h2>\n<table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Kwaliteit</th><th>EN-nummer</th><th>Typische toepassing</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Lean duplex (2304, 2101)</td><td>1.4362 / 1.4162</td><td>Constructies, opslagtanks</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Standaard duplex 2205</td><td>1.4462</td><td>Chemie, procesapparatuur, zeewater</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Superduplex 2507</td><td>1.4410</td><td>Agressieve chloridemilieus, offshore</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>De kern: fasebalans</h2>\n<p>Koelt de laszone te snel af, dan heeft austeniet geen tijd om uit ferriet te ontstaan en wordt de structuur te ferritisch; taaiheid en corrosiebestendigheid dalen. Koelt ze te langzaam af of blijft ze lang tussen 700 en 950 °C, dan ontstaan intermetallische fasen zoals de brosse <strong>sigmafase</strong>, die beide eigenschappen sterk aantasten. Het doel is een evenwichtige afkoeling daartussen.</p>\n<p>Het ferrietgehalte in lasmetaal en WBZ wordt meestal tussen ongeveer 30 en 70 % gevraagd; het exacte bereik staat in de specificatie.</p>\n<h2>Warmte-inbreng en tussenlaagtemperatuur</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2205:</strong> warmte-inbreng meestal ongeveer 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm; tussenlaagtemperatuur meestal maximaal 150 °C.</li>\n<li><strong>Superduplex 2507:</strong> smaller venster; ongeveer 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm en tussenlaag meestal maximaal 100 °C.</li>\n<li>Zeer dunne grondlagen en zeer lage warmte-inbreng geven te veel ferriet; zeer dikke lagen en heet doorwerken geven intermetallische fasen.</li>\n<li>Voorwarmen is normaal niet nodig; hooguit licht verwarmen tegen condens.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Toevoegmaterialen</h2>\n<p>Duplex-toevoegmateriaal bevat <strong>meer nikkel</strong> dan het basismateriaal. Standaard voor 2205 is <strong>2209</strong> (22 9 3 N L volgens ISO 14343); het extra nikkel zorgt voor voldoende austeniet in het snel afkoelende lasmetaal. Voor superduplex worden draden van het type 2594 (25 9 4 N L) gebruikt. Lassen zonder toevoegmateriaal geeft een te ferritische structuur en moet meestal worden vermeden.</p>\n<h2>Beschermgas en backing gas</h2>\n<p>Stikstof bevordert austeniet. Om stikstofverlies aan het oppervlak te beperken kunnen bij TIG argon met een kleine stikstoftoevoeging (typisch 1–2 %) en stikstofhoudend backing gas worden gebruikt. Oxidatie aan de grondlaagzijde is, net als bij standaard RVS, het beginpunt van corrosie (zie <a href=\"paslanmaz-kaynak-temizleme-daglama-pasivasyon.html\">beitsen en passiveren</a>).</p>\n<h2>Controle en beproeving</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ferrietmeting:</strong> met een magnetisch meetinstrument in het lasmetaal en, indien vereist, in de WBZ.</li>\n<li><strong>Kwalificatie:</strong> naast ISO 15614-1 kan de specificatie metallografie, kerfslag en een putcorrosietest volgens ASTM G48 vragen. ASTM A923 is een veelgebruikte referentie voor schadelijke intermetallische fasen.</li>\n<li><strong>Warmtebehandeling:</strong> geen spanningsarm gloeien; zo nodig alleen volledig oplosgloeien, wat bij de meeste gefabriceerde delen niet praktisch is.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Verbinden met koolstofstaal</h2>\n<p>Moet een duplexdeel aan koolstofstaal worden gelast, dan worden menging en fasebalans samen beoordeeld; afhankelijk van de omstandigheden wordt 309L of duplex-toevoegmateriaal gekozen (zie <a href=\"paslanmaz-karbon-celik-kaynagi-309l.html\">RVS aan koolstofstaal lassen</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bij ArmaWeld:</strong> bij duplexwerk houden we warmte-inbreng en tussenlaagtemperatuur binnen de WPS-grenzen en meten en registreren we ze. Ferrietmeting en aanvullende tests uit de specificatie plannen we bij de offerte, samen met de keuze van materiaal en toevoegmateriaal. <a href=\"../kaynak-yontemleri.html\">Onze lasprocessen →</a></p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_faq":"<h2>Veelgestelde vragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Met welk toevoegmateriaal las je duplex 2205?</h3><p>Meestal met 2209 (ISO 14343 22 9 3 N L). Het extra nikkel zorgt voor voldoende austeniet in het lasmetaal.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welke warmte-inbreng bij duplex?</h3><p>Bij 2205 ongeveer 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm, bij superduplex 2507 ongeveer 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm; de exacte waarde staat in WPS en specificatie.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wat is de sigmafase?</h3><p>Een brosse intermetallische fase die in duplex ontstaat bij langdurig verblijf tussen 700 en 950 °C; ze verlaagt taaiheid en corrosiebestendigheid.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hoe controleer je het ferrietgehalte?</h3><p>Met een magnetische ferrietmeter op het lasmetaal; meestal wordt ongeveer 30–70 % nagestreefd.</p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_cta_h3":"Beheerst lassen van duplex-RVS","blog_p29_duplex_cta_p":"Stuur tekening en specificatie van uw duplexdeel; we offreren met las- en testplan.","blog_p29_duplex_cta_btn":"Offerte aanvragen →","blog_related_h":"Gerelateerde artikelen","blog_tig_h1":"TIG-lassen van roestvast staal: legeringen 304 en 316L","blog_p27_pickling_h1":"RVS-lassen reinigen: aanloopkleuren, beitsen en passiveren","blog_p28_dissimilar_h1":"RVS aan koolstofstaal lassen: 309L-draad, menging en galvanische corrosie","blog_paslanmaz_celik_imalat_h1":"Gelaste constructiebouw in roestvast staal: voeding, farma, chemie"},"no":{"blog_p29_duplex_title":"Sveising av dupleks rustfritt stål (2205): ferrittbalanse, varmetilførsel og tilsett | ArmaWeld","blog_p29_duplex_meta_desc":"Hvordan sveises dupleks rustfritt 2205 (1.4462) og superdupleks? Ferritt–austenitt-balanse, grenser for varmetilførsel og mellomstrengstemperatur, 2209-tråd, nitrogenholdig beskyttelses- og rotgass, sigmafase og ferrittmåling.","blog_p29_duplex_og_title":"Sveising av dupleks rustfritt 2205","blog_p29_duplex_tag":"Rustfritt stål · Dupleks","blog_p29_duplex_h1":"Sveising av dupleks rustfritt stål (2205): ferrittbalanse, varmetilførsel og tilsett","blog_p29_duplex_breadcrumb3":"Sveising av dupleks","blog_p29_duplex_read":"6 min lesing","blog_p29_duplex_body":"<p>Dupleks rustfritt stål har en tofasestruktur med omtrent like store andeler <strong>ferritt og austenitt</strong>. Det gir omtrent dobbel flytegrense sammenlignet med 316L og langt bedre motstand mot kloridindusert spenningskorrosjon. Stålet brukes stadig mer i kjemianlegg, sjøvannssystemer, tanker og næringsmiddelutstyr. Fordelen avhenger likevel av at fasebalansen bevares under sveising.</p>\n<h2>Vanlige kvaliteter</h2>\n<table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Kvalitet</th><th>EN-nummer</th><th>Typisk bruk</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Lean dupleks (2304, 2101)</td><td>1.4362 / 1.4162</td><td>Konstruksjoner, lagertanker</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Standard dupleks 2205</td><td>1.4462</td><td>Kjemi, prosessutstyr, sjøvann</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Superdupleks 2507</td><td>1.4410</td><td>Aggressive kloridmiljøer, offshore</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Kjernen: fasebalanse</h2>\n<p>Avkjøles sveisesonen for raskt, rekker ikke austenitt å dannes fra ferritt, og strukturen blir for ferrittisk; seighet og korrosjonsbestandighet går ned. Avkjøles den for sakte eller blir lenge mellom 700 og 950 °C, dannes intermetalliske faser som sprø <strong>sigmafase</strong>, som svekker begge egenskapene kraftig. Målet er balansert avkjøling mellom disse ytterpunktene.</p>\n<p>Ferrittinnholdet i sveisemetall og HAZ kreves vanligvis mellom omtrent 30 og 70 %; nøyaktig område står i spesifikasjonen.</p>\n<h2>Varmetilførsel og mellomstrengstemperatur</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2205:</strong> varmetilførsel vanligvis omtrent 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm; mellomstrengstemperatur oftest begrenset til 150 °C.</li>\n<li><strong>Superdupleks 2507:</strong> smalere vindu; omtrent 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm og mellomstreng oftest 100 °C.</li>\n<li>Svært tynne rotstrenger og svært lav varmetilførsel gir for mye ferritt; svært tykke strenger og varmt arbeid gir intermetalliske faser.</li>\n<li>Forvarming trengs normalt ikke; bare lett oppvarming mot kondens.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Tilsettmaterialer</h2>\n<p>Dupleks tilsett inneholder <strong>mer nikkel</strong> enn grunnmaterialet. Standard for 2205 er <strong>2209</strong> (22 9 3 N L etter ISO 14343); ekstra nikkel sikrer nok austenitt i sveisemetallet som avkjøles raskt. For superdupleks brukes tråd av typen 2594 (25 9 4 N L). Sveising uten tilsett gir for ferrittisk struktur og bør vanligvis unngås.</p>\n<h2>Beskyttelses- og rotgass</h2>\n<p>Nitrogen fremmer austenitt. For å begrense nitrogentap fra overflaten kan man ved TIG bruke argon med litt nitrogen (typisk 1–2 %) og nitrogenholdig rotgass. Oksidasjon på rotsiden er, som for standard rustfritt, startpunktet for korrosjon (se <a href=\"paslanmaz-kaynak-temizleme-daglama-pasivasyon.html\">beising og passivering</a>).</p>\n<h2>Kontroll og prøving</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ferrittmåling:</strong> med magnetisk måleinstrument i sveisemetallet og ved behov i HAZ.</li>\n<li><strong>Prosedyrekvalifisering:</strong> i tillegg til ISO 15614-1 kan spesifikasjonen kreve metallografi, slagprøving og gropkorrosjonstest etter ASTM G48. ASTM A923 er en vanlig referanse for skadelige intermetalliske faser.</li>\n<li><strong>Varmebehandling:</strong> ingen spenningsavlastning; ved behov kun full innløsningsgløding, som er upraktisk for de fleste tilvirkede deler.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Sammenføyning med karbonstål</h2>\n<p>Må en duplekskomponent sveises til karbonstål, vurderes oppblanding og fasebalanse samlet; 309L- eller dupleks-tilsett velges etter forholdene (se <a href=\"paslanmaz-karbon-celik-kaynagi-309l.html\">sveising av rustfritt mot karbonstål</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Hos ArmaWeld:</strong> på duplekssjobber holder vi varmetilførsel og mellomstrengstemperatur innenfor WPS-grensene og måler og registrerer dem. Ferrittmåling og eventuelle tilleggstester i spesifikasjonen planlegges i tilbudet sammen med valg av materiale og tilsett. <a href=\"../kaynak-yontemleri.html\">Våre sveisemetoder →</a></p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_faq":"<h2>Ofte stilte spørsmål</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvilket tilsett brukes til dupleks 2205?</h3><p>Vanligvis 2209 (ISO 14343 22 9 3 N L). Ekstra nikkel sikrer nok austenitt i sveisemetallet.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvilken varmetilførsel ved dupleks?</h3><p>For 2205 omtrent 0,5–2,5 kJ/mm, for superdupleks 2507 omtrent 0,2–1,5 kJ/mm; eksakt verdi står i WPS og spesifikasjon.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hva er sigmafase?</h3><p>En sprø intermetallisk fase som dannes i dupleks som holdes mellom 700 og 950 °C; den reduserer seighet og korrosjonsbestandighet.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvordan kontrolleres ferrittinnholdet?</h3><p>Med et magnetisk ferrittmåleinstrument på sveisemetallet; vanligvis tilstrebes omtrent 30–70 %.</p></div>","blog_p29_duplex_cta_h3":"Kontrollert sveising av dupleks rustfritt","blog_p29_duplex_cta_p":"Send tegning og spesifikasjon for dupleksdelen; vi gir tilbud med sveise- og prøveplan.","blog_p29_duplex_cta_btn":"Be om tilbud →","blog_related_h":"Relaterte artikler","blog_tig_h1":"TIG-sveising av rustfritt stål: legeringene 304 og 316L","blog_p27_pickling_h1":"Rengjøring av rustfrie sveiser: anløpsfarger, beising og passivering","blog_p28_dissimilar_h1":"Sveising av rustfritt mot karbonstål: 309L-tråd, oppblanding og galvanisk korrosjon","blog_paslanmaz_celik_imalat_h1":"Sveiset fabrikasjon i rustfritt stål: Næringsmiddel, farmasi, kjemi"}};for(var l in d){var t=T[l]||(T[l]={});for(var k in d[l])t[k]=d[l][k];}})();
